{"session_log":"session.v4.jsonl","event":{"type":"tool/result","seq":18,"time":1793692575438,"data":{"turn":1,"step":1,"message":{"role":"tool","source":{"kind":"tool","callId":"call_1a59c5ee95d24a328e825898"},"toolCallId":"call_1a59c5ee95d24a328e825898","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<skill_content name=\"security-investigation\">\n<skill_resources>\nBase directory for this skill: /work/harness/workspace/.agents/skills/security-investigation\nResolve relative paths mentioned by this skill against the base directory before using them. Load referenced resources only as needed.\n</skill_resources>\n\n<skill_instructions>\n# 通用安全调查\n\n1. 确认时间范围、事件或资产对象、业务影响与期望输出。\n2. 将用户材料中的确定信息列为事实，来源不明或相互冲突的信息列为缺口。\n3. 需要实时资产、事件、路径、覆盖或可达性证据时，调用 `delegate_fault_analysis`；主 Agent 不直接使用 SOC 工具。\n4. 分开输出事实、推断、置信度、缺口和未执行建议。\n\n当前没有知识库检索服务。相关能力不可用时直接说明，不用文件、网络、策略或巡检工具代替。真实处置、规则变更和响应执行均不在本 Skill 范围内。\n\n明确 SOC 事件 ID 的威胁研判使用 `threat-analysis` Skill 和 `delegate_threat_analysis`，不归入故障分析。\n</skill_instructions>\n</skill_content>"}],"isError":false,"id":"1b72b918-b8ad-4374-b711-7cd03bcdadbc"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[17],"surfaceOp":"append"}}
